SALESFORCE DATA MODEL (EXPANDED - TRACK B)
Generated from a Victoria 2 (Clausewitz) save file + Track B Reconciliation Decisions
========================================================================

Object count: 124 Save-Game Objects & Junctions + 13 Protected Economy Artifacts

RECONCILIATION SUMMARY
------------------------------------------------------------------------
- Protected Economy Objects (13): Preserved bit-for-bit (SHA256 dd00e83a599db3e4d2028b6166b769a9faccc0e4f41a23fca16283d8f13d7c1b)
- Renamed Entities: Country_Save_State__c, Province_Save_State__c, State_Save_State__c, News_Scope_Value__c
- Flattened Sub-objects: Ideology__c, Issue__c -> Pop__c custom fields
- Junction Patterns Added: Save_Game_Country_Ref__c (271-lookup fix), Country_Country_Ref__c (116-lookup fix)

OBJECTS AND FIELDS
